vulnerabilities.suggested_fix:
Make initialization permissioned and one-time. For example:
- Set `builderAdmin` in the constructor (remove `init` entirely), OR
- In `init`, require `msg.sender == FACTORY` and `builderAdmin == address(0)`:
```solidity
function init(address _builderAdmin) external {
  require(msg.sender == FACTORY, "NOT_FACTORY");
  require(builderAdmin == address(0), "ALREADY_INIT");
  require(_builderAdmin != address(0), "ZERO_ADMIN");
  builderAdmin = _builderAdmin;
}
```
Optionally add a method to rotate admin with proper authentication.

